---
title: "Figure 7.2.5 - Start Voice/Video Call"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CallGW as Call Gateway
    participant CallCtrl as Call Controller
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant WebRTCSvc as WebRTC Service
    participant CallRepo as Call Repository
    participant RecordingSvc as Recording Service
    participant RecordingRepo as Recording Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>CallGW: POST /calls<br/>{sessionId, tracks: ["audio", "video"]}
    CallGW->>CallCtrl: Forward request

    CallCtrl->>SessionRepo: Validate session & mode
    alt Invalid session or mode
        SessionRepo-->>CallCtrl: Invalid
        CallCtrl-->>User: 400 Invalid Session Mode
    end
    SessionRepo-->>CallCtrl: Valid voice/video session

    CallCtrl->>WebRTCSvc: Create call session
    WebRTCSvc->>CallRepo: Create CallSession<br/>{status: "created", tracks}
    CallRepo-->>WebRTCSvc: Call created

    Note over WebRTCSvc: Generate server-side<br/>SDP offer
    WebRTCSvc->>CallRepo: Save SDP offer

    WebRTCSvc-->>CallCtrl: Call details {callId, sdpOffer, STUN/TURN}
    CallCtrl-->>User: 201 Created<br/>{callId, sdpOffer, servers}

    Note over User: Client sets up local media

    User->>CallGW: POST /calls/{id}/sdp<br/>{type: "answer", sdp}
    CallGW->>CallCtrl: Forward SDP answer

    CallCtrl->>WebRTCSvc: Process SDP answer
    WebRTCSvc->>CallRepo: Store SDP answer & establish connection
    CallRepo-->>WebRTCSvc: Connection established

    WebRTCSvc->>CallRepo: Update CallSession<br/>{status: "active"}

    alt Recording enabled
        WebRTCSvc->>RecordingSvc: Start recording
        RecordingSvc->>RecordingRepo: Create Recording<br/>{callId, layout, tracks}
    end

    WebRTCSvc->>EventBus: Emit call.started<br/>{callId, sessionId}

    WebRTCSvc-->>CallCtrl: Call active
    CallCtrl-->>User: 200 OK

---
title: "Figure 7.2.6 - Process Real-Time Speech (STT)"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User Client
    participant WebRTCSvc as WebRTC Service
    participant VADSvc as VAD Service
    participant STTSvc as STT Service
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant ContextSvc as Context Service
    participant LLMSvc as LLM Service
    participant TTSSvc as TTS Service
    participant MetricSvc as Metric Service
    participant MetricRepo as Metric Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    loop During active call
        Client->>WebRTCSvc: Audio chunks (RTC stream)
        WebRTCSvc->>VADSvc: Analyze audio chunk
        VADSvc->>VADSvc: Detect speech vs silence

        alt Speech detected
            VADSvc->>STTSvc: Buffer & forward audio
            STTSvc->>STTSvc: Call Whisper/Azure STT (streaming)

            loop Partial results
                STTSvc-->>OrchSvc: Partial transcript + timestamps
                OrchSvc->>TurnRepo: Create Turn<br/>{role: "user", text: partial}
            end

            Note over VADSvc: Complete utterance detected<br/>(pause/turn-end)

            STTSvc-->>OrchSvc: Final transcript + timing
            OrchSvc->>MessageRepo: Create Message<br/>{final text, audio ref}

            OrchSvc->>ContextSvc: Assemble conversation history
            ContextSvc-->>OrchSvc: Context ready

            OrchSvc->>LLMSvc: Process transcribed text
            Note over LLMSvc: Same flow as text chat
            LLMSvc-->>OrchSvc: Assistant response text

            OrchSvc->>TTSSvc: Convert to speech
            Note over TTSSvc: ElevenLabs/Azure TTS<br/>with voice profile
            TTSSvc-->>WebRTCSvc: Synthesized audio

            WebRTCSvc-->>Client: Stream audio (RTC)

            OrchSvc->>MetricSvc: Log STT/TTS latency
            MetricSvc->>MetricRepo: Store metrics

            OrchSvc->>EventBus: Emit stt.completed<br/>{turnId, latency}
        end
    end
